---
/** AI 趋势词榜单：默认三区视图静态渲染，筛选/排序/分页由浏览器接管（口径同 apps/web） */
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import SearchInput from "../../components/SearchInput.astro";
import FilterGroup from "../../components/FilterGroup.astro";
import TrendListHead from "../../components/TrendListHead.astro";
import { trendRows, trendFilters, TREND_SECTION_SIZE } from "../../lib/dataset";
import { fillRank } from "../../lib/row-html";
import { formatDateShort } from "../../lib/format";

const SECTIONS = [
  { status: "breaking", note: "近期增长显著、高于历史基线，且有多时点证据排除单点噪声" },
  { status: "gaining", note: "不追求单日爆发，但多个时间点持续升温，更适合做稳定选题" },
  { status: "new", note: "最近才发现、历史数据不足，值得观察但不能宣称已爆发" },
] as const;

const padded = (n: number) => String(n).padStart(2, "0");

const byStatus = (status: string) =>
  trendRows.filter((r) => r.status === status).sort((a, b) => b.sortTrend - a.sortTrend);

const countOf = (key: "status" | "confidence", value: string) =>
  trendRows.filter((r) => r[key] === value).length;

const statusMetaOf = (value: string) => {
  const row = trendRows.find((r) => r.status === value);
  return { label: row?.statusLabel ?? value, dot: row?.statusDot ?? "bg-ink-muted" };
};

const catOptions = [
  { value: "All", label: "全部" },
  ...trendFilters.categories.map((c) => ({
    value: c.value,
    label: trendRows.find((r) => r.category === c.value)?.catLabel ?? c.value,
  })),
];
const statusOptions = [
  { value: "all", label: "全部" },
  ...trendFilters.statuses.map((s) => ({ value: s.value, label: statusMetaOf(s.value).label })),
];
const confOptions = [
  { value: "all", label: "全部" },
  { value: "high", label: "高" },
  { value: "medium", label: "中" },
  { value: "low", label: "低" },
];

const cooling = byStatus("cooling");
const title = "AI 趋势词榜单 · Horizons";
const description =
  "以 Google Trends 搜索证据为基础的 AI 趋势词榜单：区分正在爆发、持续增长与新词观察，并给出为什么升温、可以做什么。";
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6">
    <header>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-3xl">AI 趋势词榜单</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-secondary">
        不是告诉你「什么正在流行」，而是告诉你「什么正在升温、为什么升温、现在可以做什么」。 每个词都能追溯到搜索热度证据、事件来源与可执行的机会方向。
      </p>

      <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs">
        <span class="rounded-full border border-border bg-surface px-2.5 py-1 text-ink-secondary">
          共 {trendRows.length} 个关键词
        </span>
        <span class="rounded-full border border-rose-400/25 bg-rose-400/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-rose-400">
          正在爆发 {countOf("status", "breaking")}
        </span>
        <span
          class="rounded-full border border-emerald-500/25 bg-emerald-500/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-emerald-500"
        >
          持续增长 {countOf("status", "gaining")}
        </span>
        <span class="rounded-full border border-primary/30 bg-primary/10 px-2.5 py-1 text-primary">
          新词观察 {countOf("status", "new")}
        </span>
        <span class="rounded-full border border-border bg-surface px-2.5 py-1 text-ink-secondary">
          高可信度 {countOf("confidence", "high")}
        </span>
        <span class="rounded-full border border-border bg-surface px-2.5 py-1 text-ink-muted">
          快照 {formatDateShort(trendFilters.updatedAt)}
        </span>
      </div>

      {
        trendFilters.mode === "seed" && (
          <p class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/30 bg-amber-500/10 px-3 py-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-amber-500">
            当前榜单为「结构演示数据」（seed）：字段结构与计算口径已按正式方案落地，分数由序列确定性计算；
            接入 Google Trends 采集后标记为 live，提示自动消失。热度数值为 0–100 归一化相对热度，不代表搜索次数。
          </p>
        )
      }

      <div class="mt-5">
        <SearchInput value="" action="/trends" placeholder="搜索关键词 / 意图 / 关联词" />
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="mt-6 space-y-3">
      <FilterGroup title="类别" param="cat" options={catOptions} current="All" />
      <FilterGroup title="阶段" param="status" options={statusOptions} current="all" />
      <FilterGroup title="可信度" param="conf" options={confOptions} current="all" />
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
      <span id="trends-meta" class="text-sm text-ink-muted">
        默认按三区展示：新词值得观察，持续增长适合做内容，快速爆发可能需要立即行动。
      </span>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
        <a href="#" data-sort="trend" class="rounded-full bg-primary px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-white">
          趋势强度
        </a>
        <a
          href="#"
          data-sort="opp"
          class="rounded-full border border-border bg-surface px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink-secondary transition hover:text-ink"
        >
          机会潜力
        </a>
        <a
          href="#"
          data-sort="growth"
          class="rounded-full border border-border bg-surface px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink-secondary transition hover:text-ink"
        >
          近 7 天增长
        </a>
        <a
          href="#"
          data-sort="newest"
          class="rounded-full border border-border bg-surface px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-ink-secondary transition hover:text-ink"
        >
          最新发现
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 默认视图：三个分区 + 热度回落 -->
    <div id="trends-default">
      {
        SECTIONS.map((section) => {
          const list = byStatus(section.status).slice(0, TREND_SECTION_SIZE);
          const total = countOf("status", section.status);
          const meta = statusMetaOf(section.status);
          return (
            <section class="mt-8">
              <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-3">
                <div>
                  <h2 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">
                    <span class={`h-2 w-2 rounded-full ${meta.dot}`} />
                    {meta.label}
                    <span class="text-sm font-normal text-ink-muted">{total} 个</span>
                  </h2>
                  <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">{section.note}</p>
                </div>
                <a
                  href={`/trends?status=${section.status}`}
                  data-link-status={section.status}
                  class="text-xs text-primary hover:underline"
                >
                  查看全部 {total} 个 →
                </a>
              </div>

              <div class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface">
                <div class="min-w-[1220px]">
                  <TrendListHead />
                  {list.length > 0 ? (
                    list.map((r, i) => <Fragment set:html={fillRank(r.h, i + 1)} />)
                  ) : (
                    <div class="px-4 py-10 text-center text-sm text-ink-muted">暂无符合条件的词</div>
                  )}
                </div>
              </div>
            </section>
          );
        })
      }

      {
        cooling.length > 0 && (
          <section class="mt-10">
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-3">
              <div>
                <h2 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-semibold text-ink">
                  <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-ink-muted" />
                  热度回落
                  <span class="text-sm font-normal text-ink-muted">{cooling.length} 个</span>
                </h2>
                <p class="mt-1 text-xs text-ink-muted">
                  已低于爆发峰值并向基线回归，仅作参照，不作为机会推荐
                </p>
              </div>
              <a href="/trends?status=cooling" data-link-status="cooling" class="text-xs text-primary hover:underline">
                查看全部 →
              </a>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-3 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface">
              <div class="min-w-[1220px]">
                <TrendListHead />
                {cooling.slice(0, TREND_SECTION_SIZE).map((r, i) => (
                  <Fragment set:html={fillRank(r.h, i + 1)} />
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
          </section>
        )
      }

      <section class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface p-5">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-ink">分数是怎么来的</h2>
        <div class="mt-3 grid gap-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-secondary sm:grid-cols-2">
          <p>
            <span class="font-medium text-ink">趋势强度 T</span>
            = 0.30 增长幅度 + 0.25 持续性 + 0.20 爆发强度 + 0.15 新颖度 + 0.10 数据可靠性。 回答「这个词是否值得关注」。
          </p>
          <p>
            <span class="font-medium text-ink">机会潜力 O</span>
            = 0.30 用户需求证据 + 0.25 可切入空间 + 0.20 搜索与内容机会 + 0.15 独立开发可行性 + 0.10 趋势时机。回答「是否值得投入时间做产品或 SEO」。
          </p>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 border-t border-border pt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
          两个分数不混用：热度高的词未必是好机会，竞争可能已经饱和。采样点少于 14 个的关键词显示「数据不足」， 不强行评分、不参与排名。
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- 筛选视图：由 scripts/trend-filter.ts 渲染 -->
    <div id="trends-filtered" class="hidden">
      <div class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface">
        <div class="min-w-[1220px]">
          <TrendListHead />
          <div id="trends-rows"></div>
          <div id="trends-empty" class="hidden px-4 py-16 text-center">
            <p class="text-sm text-ink-muted">没有匹配的关键词，换个筛选条件试试。</p>
            <a href="/trends" data-reset class="mt-2 inline-block text-xs text-primary hover:underline">
              重置筛选
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="mt-6" id="trends-pager" data-page-size="20"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    import { initTrendsFilter } from "../../scripts/trend-filter";
    initTrendsFilter();
  </script>
</Base>